flowchart LR
  User[User / Team] --> Client[ORBIT Web UI]
  Admin[Workspace Admin] --> Client
  Client --> Control[ORBIT Control Plane]
  Control --> Models[Hosted or Local Model Providers]
  Control --> Workflow[Durable Workflow Runtime]
  Workflow --> Workers[Isolated Execution Workers]
  Workers --> Web[Public Websites]
  Workers --> Git[Authorized GitHub Repositories]
  Workers --> Storage[(Private Artifact Storage)]
  Control --> Data[(PostgreSQL / pgvector)]
  Control --> Telemetry[Observability Backend]
